# Spinodal demixing of a binary blend using the DPD thermostat.
#
# NOTE: this input needs the parser fix from issue #21 / PR #24; without it
# the "potential dpd ..." line aborts with "failed to properly read".
# The syntax below is the correct current format.  See README.txt.
box ps
Dim 2
grid 75 75

logFreq 2000
gsdFreq 10000
fieldFreq 10000
trajFreq 1000
pmeorder 1

species A
species B

# readData must precede the integrator (integrators allocate from nstot).
readData input.data

# Velocity-Verlet integrator; DPD reads its timestep from this integrator.
integrator all VV delt 0.002

# Cell neighbor list on the 'all' group; rcut sets the DPD interaction range.
neighbor_list all 1.0

# potential dpd <group> <gamma> <kT>
potential dpd all 0.5 1.0

# Conservative Gaussian pair interactions drive the demixing.
potential gaussian A A 1.0 1.0
potential gaussian B B 1.0 1.0
potential gaussian A B 5.0 1.0
endBox

run nvt 2000001
